🧠 Explanation
Parameter	Type	Purpose
acc_id	IN	Account ID input
withdraw_amt	IN	Amount to withdraw
acc_balance	IN OUT	Takes current balance and returns new one
IF block	Ensures sufficient funds	
UPDATE	Writes the new balance into database	
